No in-scope criterion failure survived re-verification. Two OBSERVATIONS
for the backlog (both real, neither user-observable today): (a) reconcile
formatNumber/formatDollars rounding so the SSR-only pre-hydration state
can't diverge from aria-valuetext; (b) the `input[name=...]` re-resolution
in whatif-rate-assumptions.js for portfolio_value/investment_return works
only because of listener registration order — worth an explicit id-based
selector or a permanent test pinning it.
